{"id": "t155-001", "text": "Mai is pregnant! Due March 2027. She's only told family so far, so keep it quiet for now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-002", "text": "Remind me to text Hemi the day before his puppy's first vet visit on June 3rd. He's worried she won't settle in the car.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Hemi", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "puppy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first vet visit", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-003", "text": "Kwame and his wife are having the christening on 2 November 2026 at St Mary's. Their little boy is called Joseph after his grandad.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t155-004", "text": "Valentina's cat Pepper has been off her food all week. Vet thinks it might be her kidneys. Results back Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off her food", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t155-005", "text": "Bumped into Pieter at the park with his new puppy, a beagle called Rolo. Twelve weeks old and already chewing everything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new puppy, a beagle called Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t155-006", "text": "Need to buy a card for Jen's baby shower on May 14. She said they're doing a woodland theme.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a card for Jen's baby shower", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby shower", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-007", "text": "Nia had her twelve week scan yesterday and everything looks fine. She's due in early April. Her mum is already knitting. She told me her partner Karim cried at the scan, and they're thinking about finding out the sex at the twenty week one in December. She's been really tired but says the nausea has mostly stopped.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twelve week scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twenty week one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-008", "text": "Call with Oliver. His dog Biscuit turns ten on 5/14 and he's throwing her a little party with a pupcake. Honestly sounds adorable.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ten", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t155-009", "text": "Don't forget to ask Emil how the christening went. It was on Sunday and his sister was godmother.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Emil how the christening went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "godmother", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "relationship"}]}
{"id": "t155-010", "text": "Joy said the gender reveal is off. They decided it felt too much like a performance, so they're just going to announce it at Christmas instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "announce it", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-011", "text": "Pick up flea treatment and a new scratching post this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up flea treatment and a new scratching post", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-012", "text": "Finn's partner Sophie gave birth on October 12th! A girl, 3.2 kg, called Ivy. Finn sounded absolutely exhausted but over the moon. They're home now and Sophie's mum is staying with them for the first fortnight. Finn goes back to work on November 2nd and is already dreading it. Remind me to send a meal delivery voucher the week after he goes back, when things will be hardest.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gave birth", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girl", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "3.2 kg", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivy", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "absolutely exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first fortnight"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "goes back to work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a meal delivery voucher", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after he goes back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-013", "text": "I should send something to Karim the week after the baby arrives. He mentioned they're short on muslins and bibs.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to Karim", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby arrives", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "short on muslins and bibs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-014", "text": "Ali's rabbit Clover had to be put to sleep this morning. He's really cut up about it. Remind me to check in with him that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put to sleep", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-015", "text": "Emily is expecting twins! Due date is June 3rd, but the midwife said twins usually come early. She's nervous about the birth and about how they'll manage with two. Her husband has asked for extended leave but hasn't heard back from his boss yet. She's set up the cots already and showed me photos of the nursery, all pale green with little foxes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "midwife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "extended leave", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t155-016", "text": "Aisha told me her brother Milan and his wife just adopted a rescue greyhound called Dash. Apparently it sleeps nineteen hours a day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "rescue greyhound called Dash", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t155-017", "text": "Eduardo loves birdwatching and has been trying to spot a kingfisher all summer. Might be a nice gift idea, a decent pair of binoculars.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eduardo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "birdwatching", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to spot a kingfisher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "all summer"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "decent pair of binoculars", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-018", "text": "Lin's christening is March 2027 because they want her grandparents to be able to fly over from Taipei. Remind me to book the hotel the week before. Her husband Thomas is handling the church side and says there'll be a lunch afterwards at his parents' house. Lin wants me to do a reading, which I'm honoured by but also slightly terrified about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the hotel", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "honoured", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly terrified", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-019", "text": "Thomas and Gemma are both vegetarian, and Gemma can't do dairy either. Worth remembering for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do dairy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t155-020", "text": "Long chat with Lukas tonight. His parrot Mango is turning twenty-five on 2 November 2026, which he says is middle-aged for an African grey. He's thinking about getting a bigger cage and asked if I knew anyone selling one. He also mentioned his girlfriend Erin is starting a midwifery course in January and is a bit anxious about the placements.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot Mango", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning twenty-five", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about getting a bigger cage", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "midwifery course", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-021", "text": "Ethan's cat is having surgery on Tuesday to remove a lump. Text him that evening to see how she got on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-022", "text": "Meera says her sister is due any day now. She's planning to drive down to Leeds the moment she hears anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "any day now", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drive down to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the moment she hears anything", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t155-023", "text": "Sadia's baby boy arrived early, on 9/28. Both doing well. They're calling him Yusuf.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arrived", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/28", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t155-024", "text": "Remind me to drop off the casserole for Georgia the day after she gets home from hospital. She's had a rough recovery after the C-section. She's been in for five days because of an infection. Her mum is looking after the older two in the meantime, and their dog Hector has gone to a neighbour. She said she's fed up of hospital food more than anything.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off the casserole for Georgia", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gets home from hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery after the C-section", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "five days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the meantime"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Hector", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up of hospital food", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-025", "text": "Layla's dog Teddy went missing on Saturday. Still no sign of him. She's put posters up all over Hillfield.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Teddy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
