{"id": "t155-027", "text": "Mandla is godfather to his best friend's son. The christening was meant to be May 14 but they've pushed it back to June 3rd because the vicar's ill.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "godfather", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "best friend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-028", "text": "Jen mentioned she'd love a proper baby carrier, the ergonomic kind. Possible gift for after the birth.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a proper baby carrier, the ergonomic kind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t155-029", "text": "Oliver and Mai have been trying for a baby for nearly two years. They're starting IVF in the new year. Don't bring it up unless she does. Mai said the waiting and the injections are the hardest part, and Oliver is trying to stay positive for both of them. First appointment is January 8th. I should send her something small that week, just so she knows I'm thinking of her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying for a baby", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly two years"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "IVF", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "First appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 8th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something small", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-030", "text": "Must ring Pieter the morning of his wife's induction. It's booked for 11/3 at the Royal.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Pieter", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "induction", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/3", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-031", "text": "Valentina is fostering kittens for the local shelter again. Four this time, all ginger.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fostering kittens for the local shelter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-032", "text": "Spoke to Uncle Hemi on the phone. He's retiring on 2 November 2026 after thirty years at the port. Then he wants to get a dog.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thirty years at the port", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to get a dog", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-033", "text": "Kwame's daughter Nia starts nursery the week after the christening. He's more nervous about it than she is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
