{"id": "t155-036", "text": "Finn's mum is turning seventy on March 3rd. He wants to do something low key at home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning seventy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-037", "text": "Karim got a cockapoo puppy called Pudding. He said the first week has been chaos, no sleep at all.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo puppy called Pudding", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week"}]}
