{"id": "t155-043", "text": "Joseph Baker from work is going on paternity leave from June 3rd for two weeks. His wife Lin is due at the end of May. I should organise a collection the week before he goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph Baker", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "organise a collection", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before he goes", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-044", "text": "Milan's cat Smudge got hit by a car on Friday night. She survived but needs an operation on her back leg. He sounded shaken. The operation is booked for Wednesday at the emergency vet in town and will cost a fortune. His girlfriend Aisha is starting a fundraiser among friends. Remind me to chip in and to message him the day after the surgery to see how Smudge is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Smudge", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hit by a car", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fundraiser", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after the surgery", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t155-045", "text": "Thomas mentioned he and his partner had a miscarriage in the summer. He's doing okay now but it's been a hard year for them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "miscarriage", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard year", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-046", "text": "Note to self: Lukas said Erin's waters broke at 3am. She's at the hospital now. Text him tomorrow, not tonight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lukas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "waters broke", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-047", "text": "Sophie's dog Bella had six puppies on Tuesday night! She's keeping one and finding homes for the rest. She asked if I want one, which I definitely do not.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bella", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had six puppies", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-048", "text": "Remind me to text Ethan good luck the night before his presentation to the adoption panel on May 14. He and Gemma have been waiting almost a year.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Ethan good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "presentation to the adoption panel", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "almost a year"}]}
{"id": "t155-049", "text": "Meera's grandmother is turning ninety-five in March 2027. The whole family is flying in from Mumbai. Meera's in charge of the cake and slightly panicking. She's thinking of doing three tiers with marigolds on top. Her brother Milan is sorting flights for their aunties and says it's a full time job. The party is the Saturday after the birthday itself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning ninety-five", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Mumbai", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunties", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after the birthday itself", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t155-050", "text": "Erin's baby shower is cancelled because she's on bed rest. She's fine, just being careful. I should drop round with snacks and magazines.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on bed rest", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round with snacks and magazines", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
