{"id": "t155-055", "text": "Pieter's son had his first birthday on Saturday. Big party, far too many balloons. I left early to beat traffic.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t155-056", "text": "Mandla said his dog Zulu needs a new home because they're moving abroad on 2 December 2026. Remind me to ask Hemi, he's been wanting a big dog.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Zulu", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving abroad", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Hemi", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hemi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a big dog", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-057", "text": "Mai's twins are due 5/14, but she's booked in for a C-section the week before. Remind me to send flowers the day after. She's had a rough third trimester with terrible heartburn and swollen ankles, and she's been signed off work since September. Her mum is moving in for the first month, which Mai has mixed feelings about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrible heartburn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "swollen ankles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "signed off work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "since September"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "mixed feelings", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-058", "text": "Jen's hamster died. Her daughter is devastated. Apparently they're having a little garden funeral tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hamster", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "devastated", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little garden funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t155-059", "text": "Valentina and her partner are naming the baby Rosa after her great-aunt. Christening probably in spring, no date yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "great-aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-060", "text": "Quick call with Kwame. All good. Nothing new really.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "All good", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
